Suggests: wm2tj,
          fonts-noto-cjk,
          nm-connection-editor,
          pavucontrol,
          blueman
Description: top bar for wm2tj and other EWMH window managers
 A top bar drawn as a wm2tj tab laid on its side: application menu, running
 windows, virtual desktops, CPU, memory, system tray, Wi-Fi (with its own
 password prompt), input method, Bluetooth, volume, battery and clock, each
 with a menu.  It also handles the brightness and volume keys and the power
 profile, replacing a panel and a power manager.
 .
 Plain C and Xlib in one process.  It talks to the window manager only
 through EWMH properties, so it also works with other EWMH window managers.
